                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1] DISCLAIMER: This is a first impressions review, and NOT a full review [/h1]\n\nPatrician III is a game developed by Ascaron Entertainment Ltd. and published by Kalypso Media Digital and is the third game in the Patrician series\n\nThe game offers some nice graphics and a nice aesthetic, although some ugly glitches here and there, it is pleasant all the same\n\nThe game does suffer with some repetitiveness at certain areas of the game but a fun game nonetheless\n\nPatrician III overall, however, is a fun game to play, yet sometimes repetitive and it does get boring if being played for a long time, but is a really good strategy game to play in short bursts!\n\n[h1] RECOMMENDED :) [/h1]\n\n[b] REVIEW SOURCES: [/b]\n[list]\n[*] None",
